{"id":"7c550fd5ce4d17c6","group":"27","path":"27/27-df-implgraph.md","title":"2-CNF implication graph","display":"df-implgraph — 2-CNF implication graph","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications","book_abbrev":"27","label":"27-df-implgraph","aliases":["27-df-implgraph"],"display":"df-implgraph — 2-CNF implication graph","depends_on":["[[27-df-cnf]]","[[27-df-clause]]","[[27-df-literal]]"],"source_file":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf","source_section":"§5.4.3 implication graph; §5.6.1","source_printed_pages":"212–213, 230–234","source_pdf_pages":"236–237, 254–258","verification_status":"source-construction-checked-CNF-complement-translation"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Boolean Functions: Theory, Algorithms, and Applications"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"27"},{"key":"label","html":"27-df-implgraph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>27-df-implgraph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-implgraph — 2-CNF implication graph"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6b749704e82fc727\" href=\"?note=6b749704e82fc727\" title=\"27-df-cnf\">27-df-cnf</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_file","html":"C:\\Users\\lzy\\Documents\\BaiduSyncdisk\\calibre\\Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algorith (5073)\\Boolean Functions_ Theory, Algo - Yves Crama, Peter L. Hammer.pdf"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.4.3 implication graph; §5.6.1"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"212–213, 230–234"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"236–237, 254–258"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-construction-checked-CNF-complement-translation"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)\">\\(\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)\\)</span>；子句和文字补见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"74438714e304bba9\" href=\"?note=74438714e304bba9\" title=\"27-df-clause\">27-df-clause</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"99c92f3457aacd12\" href=\"?note=99c92f3457aacd12\" title=\"27-df-literal\">27-df-literal</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_C\">\\(E_C\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)\">\\(\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)\\)</span> 由下式构造；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}\">\\(\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Lit}_n\">\\(\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\)</span> 上的二元谓词，路径采用指标集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}\">\\(\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_C\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,b)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\land\\exists K\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{CLits}(K)=\\{a,b\\})\\}\\cup\\{(\\bar b,a)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\land\\exists K\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{CLits}(K)=\\{a,b\\})\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_C\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,b)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\land\\exists K\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{CLits}(K)=\\{a,b\\})\\}\\cup\\{(\\bar b,a)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\land\\exists K\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{CLits}(K)=\\{a,b\\})\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_C).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_C).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}(a,b)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;(v_0=a\\land v_r=b\\land\\forall j\\in\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t&lt;r\\}\\;((v_j,v_{j+1})\\in E_C)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}(a,b)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;(v_0=a\\land v_r=b\\land\\forall j\\in\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t&lt;r\\}\\;((v_j,v_{j+1})\\in E_C)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>允许 a=b，因此单位子句 {a} 产生边 ¬a→a。空子句没有图边，须由 2-SAT 判据单独排除。reachability 在这里内建，不依赖 58 号图论原子。原书采用二次 DNF 的零方程；这里将每项逐个取补后得到等价 2-CNF 的 SAT 形式。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"27-df-cnf","status":"resolved","id":"6b749704e82fc727","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-cnf]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-clause]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[27-df-literal]]","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-clause","status":"resolved","id":"74438714e304bba9","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$，$\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)$；子句和文字补见 [[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-literal]]。$E_C$ 与 $\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)$ 由下式构造；$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}$ 是 $\\mathrm{Lit}_n$ 上的二元谓词，路径采用指标集 $\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}$。","embed":false},{"target":"27-df-literal","status":"resolved","id":"99c92f3457aacd12","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$，$\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)$；子句和文字补见 [[27-df-clause]]、[[27-df-literal]]。$E_C$ 与 $\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)$ 由下式构造；$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}$ 是 $\\mathrm{Lit}_n$ 上的二元谓词，路径采用指标集 $\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)","display":false},{"tex":"E_C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Lit}_n","display":false},{"tex":"\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}","display":false},{"tex":"E_C\\coloneqq\\{(\\bar a,b)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\land\\exists K\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{CLits}(K)=\\{a,b\\})\\}\\cup\\{(\\bar b,a)\\mid a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\land\\exists K\\in C\\;(\\mathrm{CLits}(K)=\\{a,b\\})\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ImpGraph}(C)\\coloneqq(\\mathrm{Lit}_n,E_C).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall a,b\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n\\quad\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}(a,b)\\;\\leftrightarrow\\;\\exists r\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists(v_0,\\ldots,v_r)\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n^{\\{0,\\ldots,r\\}}\\;(v_0=a\\land v_r=b\\land\\forall j\\in\\{t\\in\\mathbb N:t<r\\}\\;((v_j,v_{j+1})\\in E_C)).","display":true}],"bytes":1899,"backlinks":[{"id":"5244dbb38da17b8a","anchor":"ref-240","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[27-df-implgraph|df-implgraph — 2-CNF implication graph]]"},{"id":"32221074998ee3fd","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$C\\in\\mathrm{CNF}_n$，$\\forall K\\in C\\;(|\\mathrm{CLits}(K)|\\leq2)$；$E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]，$\\mathrm{encCNF}$ 见 [[27-df-encoding]]，$\\mathbf P$ 见 [[27-df-classP]]。"},{"id":"434aabfaf35a832d","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)$；$\\mathrm{CLits},C_L$ 与 $E_C,\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_C}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]。对文字 $\\ell$，$\\bar\\ell$ 为文字补。"},{"id":"17ad1c5fc4b5bdd8","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$；$C_D$ 为 [[27-thm-quadforcedliterals]] 中由 $D$ 的各项逐文字取补构成的 $2$-CNF。$\\xi,\\eta\\in\\mathrm{Lit}_n$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0\\land\\xi(a)=1)$ 且 $\\exists b\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(b)=0\\land\\eta(b)=0)$。$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]。"},{"id":"76d402e4544e2209","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$n\\in\\mathbb N$，$D\\in\\mathrm{QuadDNF}_n$，$f=\\mathrm{EvalDNF}_n(D)$，$\\exists a\\in\\mathbb B^n\\;(f(a)=0)$；$C_D$ 为 [[27-thm-quadforcedliterals]] 中从 $D$ 构造的 $2$-CNF。$\\mathrm{PI},\\mathrm{Lits}$ 见 [[27-thm-quadprime]]；$\\mathrm{Lit}_n,\\mathrm{ConsLit}_n$ 见 [[27-df-literal]]，$\\mathrm{Reach}_{E_{C_D}}$ 见 [[27-df-implgraph]]。$L_1$ 由下式定义。"}],"outgoing":["6b749704e82fc727","74438714e304bba9","99c92f3457aacd12"]}